WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.200
01 · Editor
Write Markdown, get pages. A4 or Letter, as you type.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:23.900
02 · Layout
Headers, footers, page numbers. Charts, diagrams, math and footnotes too.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:34.400
03 · Themes
Change the look, not the Markdown. Templates and themes, your fonts, a cover.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:42.800
04 · AI
An assistant that writes with you. It edits while you watch.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:51.200
05 · Knowledge
Answers from your own files. PDF, Word or Excel files.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:01:06.000
06 · Collaboration
Write together, live. Cursors, comments, @mentions.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:18.600
07 · History
Every change, with a diff. Restore any version in one click.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:25.000
Under the hood.
MCP server · /mcp · Self-hosting · ./install.sh · Your own AI key

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000
08 · MCP server
Bring your own agent. Claude Code, Claude Desktop or Cursor, through /mcp.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.500
09 · Self-hosting
Self-host with one script. The whole stack on one Linux machine, with Docker or Podman.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.500
10 · Your AI
Bring your own key. OpenAI-compatible, or a local model.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.800
11 · Share & export
Share a link, export the PDF. The PDF matches the preview.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:46.000
The exported PDF

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Beautifully rendered Markdown. Write plain text. Hand over a finished document.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:58.633
Free on markoto.app. No sign-up needed. Or host it yourself.
Source-available · github.com/markoto-app/markoto
